/-!
# A162371

Lexicographically earliest permutation of the natural numbers such that, when seen as a triangle read by rows, for n>1 the sums of rows are prime numbers.

The 72 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A162371

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 8, 6, 7, 9, 15,
    10, 11, 12, 13, 21, 14, 16, 17, 18, 19,
    23, 20, 22, 24, 25, 26, 27, 29, 28, 30,
